  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc32:9.3.7": "Sp-ṭ 1.30: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ekasmiṁ pakkhe ekadivasaṁ dātabbaṁ bhattaṁ pakkhikaṁ</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Pakkhikaṁ</i> means: meal to be given one day in one half-month.” ",
